# CA chain for list.worldfloraonline.org (World Flora Online GraphQL API).
#
# The WFO server does not send its intermediate certificate, so standard
# Linux OpenSSL clients fail verification (cURL error 60). This bundle
# supplies the missing intermediate plus its root and is used only for
# the WFO request in WfoController. Regenerate if WFO changes CA:
#   1) intermediate: AIA 'CA Issuers' URL in the served leaf certificate
#   2) root: the intermediate's issuer, from the system CA store
#
# Intermediate: Network Solutions RSA OV SSL CA 3
